{"sourceUrl":"https://iab.sustech.edu.cn/Announce-detail-id-52.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:34.290532+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://iab.sustech.edu.cn/Announce-detail-id-52.html","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://iab.sustech.edu.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20250423/1745389275684088.png\" title=\"1745389275684088.png\"/></p><p><span><span>南方科技大学（简称：南科大）是深圳在中国高等教育改革发展的时代背景下创建的一所高起点、高定位的公办新型研究型大学。</span>2022年2月14日，教育部等三部委公布第二轮“双一流”建设高校及建设学科名单</span><span><span>。南方科技大学发扬</span><span>“敢闯敢试、求真务实、改革创新、追求卓越”的创校精神，突出“创知、创新、创业”（Research, Innovation and Entrepreneurship）的办学特色，践行“明德求是、日新自强”的校训精神，大力培养创新人才，目标是建成国际化高水平研究型大学、建成中国重大科学技术研究与拔尖创新人才培养重要基地。</span></span></p><p><span>本夏令营旨在增进优秀大学生对南科大前沿生物技术研究院的了解，加深对当前生物技术研究热点的认识，提供一个跨学科间优秀大学生相互交流的平台，同时提前选拔</span><span>202</span><span>6级</span><span>推免硕士研究生。南科大将为录取的优秀学子提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件</span><span>，</span><span>欢迎全国学子踊跃报名！</span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span>一、报名对象</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>预计可</span><span><span>获得所在高校</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年保送资格</span><span>的</span><span>本科在校生；</span></p><p><span>2.就读于</span><span>生命科学</span><span>、</span><span>医学等</span><span>相关专业</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>成绩优秀，英语水平良好</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>科研</span><span>兴趣浓厚，有较强的分析问题、解决问题</span><span>和</span><span>创新</span><span>能力；</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>二、活动安排</span></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong><strong><span>:</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>中上</span></strong><strong><span>旬（暂定）</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong><strong><span>:</span></strong><span>开营仪式、师生</span><span>见面会</span><span>、</span><span>实验室参观、</span><span>前沿领域讲座、营员展示、</span><span>面试</span><span>、</span><span>闭营仪式等；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>活动费用：</span></strong><span>此次活动不收取任何费用，届时</span><span>我</span><span>研究院将为异地学校营员按照</span><span>我校财务规定</span><span>标准报销食宿，并给予部分路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿，</span><span>仅提供免费用餐</span><span>。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>*</span></strong><span>具体</span><span>活动安排以最终</span><span>通知</span><span>为准，请大家持续关注</span><span>，</span><span>营员须按要求准时参加活动。</span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span>三、申请</span><span>流程</span></p><p><strong><span>第一步：登录</span></strong><strong><span><span>南科大</span><span>“研究生招生服务系统”</span></span></strong><strong><span>网上</span></strong><strong><span>报名（截止日期：</span></strong><strong><span>2025年6月30日</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><p><span><span>电脑端登陆</span> <span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）。点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营” ，</span></span><span>院系选择</span><strong><span>“前沿生物技术研究院”</span></strong><span>，</span><span> 进行在线报名。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>*</span><span>申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span> 第二步：邮件发送</span></strong><strong><span>申请</span></strong><strong><span>材料</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）夏令营申请表（可通过报名系统生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span>身份证正反面扫描件；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）</span></span><span>学生证扫描件（包含注册页）；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）截止申请时的成绩单</span></span><span>，</span><span>须</span><span>加盖院系或教务公章</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span><span>）个人简历，须涵盖个人基本信息、学校、专业、英文能力、年级排名（示例：</span><span>1/100）、</span></span><span>GPA、</span><span>科研和获奖情况，社会工作等；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span>6）副教授以上专家书面推荐信2份</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span>7）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（</span><span>包括但不限于英语证明材料、</span><span>代表性学术论文首页、专利</span><span>及</span><span>各类获奖证书等）</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>*</span></strong><span>将以上</span><span>证明材料</span><span>按照顺序</span><span>合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，发送至：</span><strong><span>i</span></strong><strong><span>ab</span></strong><strong><span>-yzb</span></strong><strong><span>@</span></strong><strong><span>sustech.</span></strong><strong><span>edu.cn</span></strong><span><span>，邮件主题及</span>PDF</span><span>文档均以</span><strong><span>“202</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span><span>夏令营</span>+姓名+学校+专业”</span></strong><span>命名</span><span>。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>备注：</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span><span>申请者所发送至邮箱的材料内容信息必须与网报信息完全一致；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>夏令营评审工作小组将</span><span>根据学生投递材料的时间顺序分批进行审核并邮件回复审核结果。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>四、</span><span>联系方式</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.邮箱：</span><span>iab</span><span>-yzb</span><span>@</span><span>sustech.</span><span>edu.cn（</span><span>咨询</span><span>请以</span><strong><span>“202</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong><strong><span>咨询</span></strong><strong><span>+姓名</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>为</span><span>主</span><span>题发送邮件）</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.电话：0755-88010089</span><span>（程</span><span>老师</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>0755-880100</span><span>7</span><span>9</span><span>（</span><span>曹</span><span>老师</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>网站：</span><span><span> https://iab.sustech.edu.cn/Index-index</span></span><span><span>打开了解更多研究院介绍及各</span><span>PI研究方向</span></span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span>五、其他注意事项</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>后续通知主要以电子邮件的形式发送，申请时务必使用个人常用邮箱；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>确保填写信息和提交材料的真实性，否则，将取消报名资格；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>夏令营活动日期及未尽事宜，以前沿生物技术研究院通知为准。</span></p><p><span> </span><span> </span></p><p><span>南方科技大学前沿生物技术研究院</span><span>简介</span></p><p><span>  </span></p><p><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://iab.sustech.edu.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20250423/1745389299381268.png\" title=\"1745389299381268.png\"/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>   </span><span>南方科技大学前沿生物技术研究院</span><span>（</span><span>简称“研究院”</span><span>）</span><span>，于2022年1月8日揭牌成立，</span><span>由</span><span>美国科学院院士朱健康教授任</span><span>研究院</span><span>院长。研究院面向国家重大需求、科技前沿,探索生命科学奥秘。以基因编辑技术为抓手，实现原始理论创新，突破核心关键技术，创新产业化应用。</span></p><p><span>研究院</span><span>聚焦生物育种、基因治疗与衰老干预等生命科学领域的关键科学和技术问题，以卓越的前沿生命科学研究和高效成果转化服务于粮食安全和人民生命健康等国家重大战略需求。</span></p><p><strong><span>*</span></strong><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年，我</span><span>研究</span><span>院</span><span>将依托</span><strong><span>“0710</span></strong><strong><span>生物学</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>的学科方向招收推免硕士</span><span>生</span><span>。欢迎优秀学子积极申报！</span><span>丰富的业余活动和学术盛宴等</span><span>你</span><span>来。</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f33757f93b758117c95e1b9024438d778e0ceb66f53dc4d0673426332313140d","textLength":1793,"sourceSha256":"ed80856c268f81f0b189dc4943e2211d3b6b774a84bc6ec058e27673ba1ab41a","selector":"article-like:default-content border-bottom-thik","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-62e3ea70a927a6bd006f","title":"2025年南方科技大学前沿生物技术研究院2025年夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:34.290532+00:00"}
